Today is Saturday.
It is my day off.
I am going to Marine Drive today.
I talk to my neighbour Asha.
I ask her for the way.
Asha says, "Maya, first take your daily bus."
"Get down at the big junction."
"Go straight from there."
"Then turn left."
"Walk towards the big red building."
"The other bus stop is there."
"Take the bus for South Mumbai from there."
I listen to Asha carefully.
I write the route on a piece of paper.
I thank Asha.
Now I am ready.
I take my bag and leave the house.
